sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant P as Popup
  participant C as Content script
  participant S as Service worker
  participant ST as chrome.storage.local
  participant G as Gemini (optional)

  U->>P: Click Fill on a job page
  P->>C: FILL_FORM via sendToActiveTab
  Note over P,C: No receiver yet? Popup injects content.js and retries once
  C->>C: detectAts, extract JD, collect custom questions
  C->>S: GENERATE_ANSWERS (jd, questions, pageUrl)
  S->>ST: read resume, settings, learned defaults
  S->>S: build deterministic answers from the profile
  opt Gemini key saved and JD or questions present
    S->>G: tailored answers (resume sanitized, demographics excluded)
    G-->>S: answers, or error and warning fallback
  end
  S->>ST: save lastAnswers for review
  S-->>C: answers
  C->>C: map fields to answers and fill inputs
  C->>S: LOG_APPLICATION (status filled, fill report)
  C-->>P: filled count and unresolved fields
  P-->>U: review answers, edit, then submit yourself
